# Keep every text file LF in the repository *and* in the working tree on every
# platform. The release gates, the artifact smoke and CI all read the same text
# on Windows and on Linux, so mixed line endings are a bug farm: a Windows
# checkout would otherwise rewrite 83 files to CRLF, change their hashes and
# make `npm run smoke:artifact` / `verify:install` compare different bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let Git touch the bytes of binary artifacts.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
